&lt;code&gt;type?&lt;/code&gt; nullable or optional &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;code&gt;a.b&lt;/code&gt; embedded field &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;code&gt;a[].b&lt;/code&gt; field of an embedded array&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;grey rows&lt;/span&gt; — bookkeeping columns shared by every row of that kind&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d4ed8&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/span&gt; enforced relation &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;╍╍&lt;/span&gt; logical, same context &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#db2777&quot;&gt;╍╍&lt;/span&gt; logical, across contexts&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;synced&lt;/b&gt; in a table subtitle = pulled to the phone by &lt;code&gt;POST /sync&lt;/code&gt;; everything else is server-only." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f6f7;strokeColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0f172a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="100" width="620" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mgnote" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;Rules the shapes follow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
• &lt;b&gt;userId&lt;/b&gt; on every member collection is Identity's &lt;code&gt;users.id&lt;/code&gt; (Postgres uuid) as a string — a cross-store logical reference, never a join.&lt;br&gt;
• A context never reads another context's collection: cross-context ids (&lt;code&gt;→ sessions&lt;/code&gt;) are resolved through a QueryBus handler or kept as a snapshot.&lt;br&gt;
• Client-minted &lt;b&gt;UUIDv7&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;_id&lt;/code&gt; for anything the phone creates offline; server-only rows use &lt;b&gt;ObjectId&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
• Every write goes through &lt;code&gt;MongoRepositoryBase&lt;/code&gt;: filter &lt;code&gt;{ _id, userId, updatedAt }&lt;/code&gt;, so &lt;code&gt;updatedAt&lt;/code&gt; must be declared.&lt;br&gt;
• Unique over an optional field = &lt;b&gt;partial&lt;/b&gt; index (missing and null are one value in Mongo).&lt;br&gt;
• Recurrence is a rule plus exceptions, never expanded rows. Messages are immutable, pulled by &lt;code&gt;seq&lt;/code&gt;." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f6f7f8;strokeColor=#475569;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0f172a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="100" width="900" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g_MongoDB___Contexts__Atlas__Planning_____contexts_planning" value="Planning  ·  contexts/planning" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f6fe;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=18;spacingTop=10;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2563eb;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="380" width="989" height="798" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_MongoDB___Contexts__Atlas__labels" value="labels&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;font-weight:normal;opacity:0.85&quot;&gt;Label — synced&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=table;startSize=40;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fixedRows=1;rowLines=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;resizeLast=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#2563eb;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=14;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="g_MongoDB___Contexts__Atlas__Planning_____contexts_planning"><mxGeometry x="36" y="62" width="434" height="326" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_MongoDB___Contexts__Atlas__labels__0" value="" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;fillColor=none;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;top=0;left=0;right=0;bottom=0;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="t_MongoDB___Contexts__Atlas__labels"><mxGeometry y="40" width="434" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_MongoDB___Contexts__Atlas__labels__0_0" value="PK" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=#ffffff;top=0;left=0;