"10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="827" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:34px&quot;&gt;Extension store — Dexie on IndexedDB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#475569&quot;&gt;extension/lib/db.ts · database &quot;botvy&quot; · version 4 · only primary keys are indexed (IndexedDB does not index null) · tokens and settings live in chrome.storage, not here&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#0f172a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="2000" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b style=&quot;color:#b45309&quot;&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; primary key &amp;nbsp; &lt;b style=&quot;color:#1d4ed8&quot;&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; enforced foreign key &amp;nbsp; &lt;b style=&quot;color:#2563eb&quot;&gt;ref&lt;/b&gt; logical reference (no constraint)&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b style=&quot;color:#15803d&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/b&gt; unique &amp;nbsp; &lt;i&gt;IX / UX / TTL&lt;/i&gt; — index rows at the foot of each table&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;type?&lt;/code&gt; nullable or optional &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;code&gt;a.b&lt;/code&gt; embedded field &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;code&gt;a[].b&lt;/code&gt; field of an embedded array&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;grey rows&lt;/span&gt; — bookkeeping columns shared by every row of that kind&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1d4ed8&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/span&gt; enforced relation &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;╍╍&lt;/span&gt; logical, same context &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;color:#db2777&quot;&gt;╍╍&lt;/span&gt; logical, across contexts" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f6f7;strokeColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0f172a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="100" width="620" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="exnote" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;What this cache is&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
The side panel re-mounts on every close, so entities live here and the service worker owns the socket.&lt;br&gt;
It is a cache of &lt;code&gt;/sync&lt;/code&gt;: an unreadable database is deleted and rebuilt by a full pull — but never while &lt;code&gt;pending_ops&lt;/code&gt; holds unsent work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;captures&lt;/code&gt; is its own store because a capture (a reminder, a saved link) is a &lt;b&gt;command&lt;/b&gt; against entities this surface does not hold, not a synced row." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f6f7;strokeColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0f172a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="100" width="760" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g_Extension___Dexie_IndexedDB__v4__Synced_entities__SDK_rows_" value="Synced entities (SDK rows)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f6fe;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=18;spacingTop=10;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2563eb;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="380" width="954" height="966" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_Extension___Dexie_IndexedDB__v4__labels" value="labels&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;font-weight:normal;opacity:0.85&quot;&gt;LabelRow&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=table;startSize=40;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fixedRows=1;rowLines=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;resizeLast=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#2563eb;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=1.5;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=14;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="g_Extension___Dexie_IndexedDB__v4__Synced_entities__SDK_rows_"><mxGeometry x="36" y="62" width="406" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_Extension___Dexie_IndexedDB__v4__labels__0" value="" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;fillColor=none;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;top=0;left=0;right=0;bottom=0;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="t_Extension___Dexie_IndexedDB__v4__labels"><mxGeometry y="40" width="406" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_Extension___Dexie_IndexedDB__v4__labels__0_0" va